{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TO BE CLEAR: YOU NEED TO BE SOMEWHAT FAMILIAR WITH HOW PROGRAMMING WORKS IN ORDER TO ENJOY THIS GAME.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-DC is an open-ended programming puzzle game (a &quot;zach-like&quot;), featuring a fictional low-level programming language. There are only three base commands; the rest depends on the commands' parameters (somewhat like SIC-1). This challenges the player to think in abstract and minimal terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How can you calculate a sine wave with only two variables? That's up to you to figure out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 base levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 bonus levels, featuring negative numbers and a third variable slot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A commands par in each level that you can optimize for;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 achievements, ranging from tedious to confusing;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple level editor, with more variable slots and a greater range of values</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voicelogs left by your boss, to inform you about his search for your missing wife.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"WHY IS THIS AN OPTION?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4105760/45a5daef5b8f5a097920f71fa1baf9878dd63880.jpg"},{"name":"SHUT UP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4105760/f9e174061f13b1971b72c2d7ccd4617c3cac6863.jpg"},{"name":"WORKING OVERTIME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4105760/861721e639fb86d0656e2209fc6d462ec7b49948.jpg"},{"name":"WELL EDUCATED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4105760/d3a4ed54f29769c0b20d253909d2413f5e9e3cc9.jpg"},{"name":"ACKNOWLEDGEMENT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams